// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// BANF Bosonto Utsob 2026 ΓÇö Dashboard Application JS// Injected into HTML at build time by bosonto-process-generator.js// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// ΓöÇΓöÇ Helpers ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇfunction toast(msg, type) {  type = type || 'info';  var el = document.createElement('div');  el.className = 'toast ' + type;  el.textContent = msg;  document.getElementById('toastContainer').appendChild(el);  setTimeout(function() { el.remove(); }, 3500);}function audit(action, detail, category, email) {  STATE.audit = STATE.audit || [];  STATE.audit.unshift({    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),    action: action,    detail: detail,    category: category || 'system',    email: email || '',    admin: 'System'  });  if (STATE.audit.length > 500) STATE.audit = STATE.audit.slice(0, 500);  saveState();}function openModal(title, body, footer) {  var h = '<div class="modal-overlay" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeModal()">';  h += '<div class="modal">';  h += '<div class="modal-header"><h3>' + title + '</h3><button class="btn sm" onclick="closeModal()">Γ£ò</button></div>';  h += '<div class="modal-body">' + body + '</div>';  if (footer) h += '<div class="modal-footer">' + footer + '</div>';  h += '</div></div>';  document.getElementById('modalContainer').innerHTML = h;}function closeModal() {  document.getElementById('modalContainer').innerHTML = '';}// ΓöÇΓöÇ Navigation ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇvar currentView = 'dashboard';function render(view) {  currentView = view || currentView;  var content = document.getElementById('content');  // Update active nav  document.querySelectorAll('#sideNav button').forEach(function(b) {    b.classList.toggle('active', b.dataset.view === currentView);  });  switch(currentView) {    case 'dashboard': content.innerHTML = renderDashboard(); bindDashboardEvents(); break;    case 'pipeline': content.innerHTML = renderPipeline(); bindPipelineEvents(); break;    case 'email_agent': content.innerHTML = renderEmailAgent(); break;    case 'analyzer_agent': content.innerHTML = renderAnalyzerAgent(); break;    case 'membership_agent': content.innerHTML = renderMembershipAgent(); bindMembershipEvents(); break;    case 'payment_agent': content.innerHTML = renderPaymentAgent(); bindPaymentEvents(); break;    case 'comm_agent': content.innerHTML = renderCommAgent(); bindCommEvents(); break;    case 'event_agent': content.innerHTML = renderEventAgent(); break;    case 'member_process': content.innerHTML = renderMemberProcess(); bindMemberProcessEvents(); break;    case 'test_member': content.innerHTML = renderTestMember(); bindTestMemberEvents(); break;    case 'attendance': content.innerHTML = renderAttendance(); break;    case 'audit': content.innerHTML = renderAudit(); break;    default: content.innerHTML = renderDashboard(); bindDashboardEvents();  }  updateNavCounts();}// Sidebar nav click handlersdocument.querySelectorAll('#sideNav button').forEach(function(btn) {  btn.addEventListener('click', function() { render(btn.dataset.view); });});// Global searchdocument.getElementById('globalSearch').addEventListener('input', function(e) {  if (currentView === 'member_process' || currentView === 'membership_agent' || currentView === 'payment_agent') {    render(currentView); // re-render with filter  }});document.getElementById('refreshBtn').addEventListener('click', function() {  toast('Pipeline refreshed', 'success');  render(currentView);});function updateNavCounts() {  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) { return r.rsvp === 'yes'; });  document.getElementById('navTotalCount').textContent = STATE.pipeline.length;  document.getElementById('navYesCount').textContent = yes.length;  document.getElementById('navPendingMembership').textContent = yes.filter(function(r) { return !r.selectedCategory; }).length;  document.getElementById('navPendingPayment').textContent = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.selectedCategory && r.paymentStatus !== 'paid'; }).length;}function getSearchFilter() {  var el = document.getElementById('globalSearch');  return el ? el.value.toLowerCase() : '';}function matchesFilter(rec, filter) {  if (!filter) return true;  return rec.displayName.toLowerCase().includes(filter) ||    rec.email.includes(filter) ||    (rec.phone || '').includes(filter) ||    (rec.city || '').toLowerCase().includes(filter);}function stageStatusTag(status) {  var label = (status || 'not_started').replace(/_/g, ' ');  return '<span class="tag ' + (status || 'not_started') + '">' + label + '</span>';}function getCategoryById(id) {  return STATE.categories.find(function(c) { return c.id === id; });}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// DASHBOARD VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderDashboard() {  var p = STATE.pipeline;  var yes = p.filter(function(r) { return r.rsvp === 'yes'; });  var no = p.filter(function(r) { return r.rsvp === 'no'; });  var agg = STATE.aggregation;  var membershipDone = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.selectedCategory; });  var paymentDone = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.paymentStatus === 'paid'; });  var commDone = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.commVerified; });  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒôè Bosonto Utsob 2026 ΓÇö Process Dashboard</h2>';  // Event Info Banner  h += '<div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(99,102,241,.1),rgba(167,139,250,.1));border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,.2);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px">';  h += '<div><div style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700">≡ƒî╕ ' + esc(STATE.event.name) + '</div>';  h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)">≡ƒôà ' + STATE.event.date + ' ┬╖ ≡ƒôì ' + esc(STATE.event.venue) + ' ┬╖ ≡ƒæÑ Capacity: ' + STATE.event.capacity + '</div></div>';  h += '<div style="text-align:right"><div style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">Payment Deadline</div>';  h += '<div style="font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--warn)">' + STATE.event.paymentDeadline + '</div></div>';  h += '</div>';  // Stat Cards  h += '<div class="stat-grid">';  h += statCard('≡ƒôº', 'Total Responses', p.length, '', 'var(--info)', 100);  h += statCard('Γ£à', 'Attending (Yes)', yes.length, '', 'var(--success)', yes.length / Math.max(p.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('Γ¥î', 'Declined (No)', no.length, '', 'var(--danger)', no.length / Math.max(p.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒæ¿ΓÇì≡ƒæ⌐ΓÇì≡ƒæºΓÇì≡ƒæª', 'Total Attendees', agg.totalAttendees, agg.totalAdults + 'A + ' + agg.totalKids + 'K', 'var(--accent2)', agg.totalAttendees / STATE.event.capacity * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒÄ»', 'Membership Done', membershipDone.length + '/' + yes.length, Math.round(membershipDone.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100) + '%', 'var(--teal)', membershipDone.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒÆ│', 'Payments Done', paymentDone.length + '/' + yes.length, Math.round(paymentDone.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100) + '%', 'var(--success)', paymentDone.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('Γ£à', 'Comm Verified', commDone.length + '/' + yes.length, Math.round(commDone.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100) + '%', 'var(--pink)', commDone.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒì╜∩╕Å', 'Dietary Info', (agg.totalAttendees - agg.unknownDiet) + '/' + agg.totalAttendees, agg.unknownDiet + ' unknown', 'var(--warn)', (agg.totalAttendees - agg.unknownDiet) / Math.max(agg.totalAttendees, 1) * 100);  h += '</div>';  // Pipeline Flow Overview  h += '<h3 style="margin-bottom:12px">≡ƒöä Agent Pipeline Status</h3>';  h += '<div class="pipeline-flow">';  STATE.stages.forEach(function(stage, idx) {    var completed = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.stages[stage.id] && r.stages[stage.id].status === 'completed'; }).length;    var pending = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.stages[stage.id] && (r.stages[stage.id].status === 'pending' || r.stages[stage.id].status === 'in_progress'); }).length;    var cls = completed === yes.length ? 'completed' : pending > 0 ? 'active' : '';    h += '<div class="pipeline-stage ' + cls + '">';    h += '<div class="stage-icon">' + stage.icon + '</div>';    h += '<div class="stage-name">' + esc(stage.name) + '</div>';    h += '<div class="stage-count">' + completed + '/' + yes.length + '</div>';    h += '<div style="font-size:.58rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(stage.agent) + '</div>';    h += '</div>';    if (idx < STATE.stages.length - 1) h += '<div class="pipeline-arrow">ΓåÆ</div>';  });  h += '</div>';  // Quick action cards for pending items  var pendingMembership = yes.filter(function(r) { return !r.selectedCategory; });  var pendingPayment = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.selectedCategory && r.paymentStatus !== 'paid'; });  var pendingComm = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.selectedCategory && !r.commVerified; });  if (pendingMembership.length > 0 || pendingPayment.length > 0 || pendingComm.length > 0) {    h += '<h3 style="margin:20px 0 12px">ΓÜí Action Required</h3>';    h += '<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:12px">';    if (pendingMembership.length > 0) {      h += '<div class="stat-card" style="cursor:pointer" onclick="render(\'membership_agent\')">';      h += '<div class="icon">≡ƒÄ»</div><div class="value">' + pendingMembership.length + '</div>';      h += '<div class="label">Membership Selection Pending</div>';      h += '<div style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">' + pendingMembership.map(function(r) { return esc(r.displayName); }).join(', ') + '</div>';      h += '<div class="bar" style="width:100%;background:var(--warn)"></div></div>';    }    if (pendingPayment.length > 0) {      h += '<div class="stat-card" style="cursor:pointer" onclick="render(\'payment_agent\')">';      h += '<div class="icon">≡ƒÆ│</div><div class="value">' + pendingPayment.length + '</div>';      h += '<div class="label">Payment Pending</div>';      h += '<div style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">' + pendingPayment.map(function(r) { return esc(r.displayName); }).join(', ') + '</div>';      h += '<div class="bar" style="width:100%;background:var(--danger)"></div></div>';    }    if (pendingComm.length > 0) {      h += '<div class="stat-card" style="cursor:pointer" onclick="render(\'comm_agent\')">';      h += '<div class="icon">Γ£à</div><div class="value">' + pendingComm.length + '</div>';      h += '<div class="label">Communication Verification Pending</div>';      h += '<div class="bar" style="width:100%;background:var(--info)"></div></div>';    }    h += '</div>';  }  // Important notice  h += '<div style="margin-top:20px;padding:14px 18px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.08);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.2);border-radius:10px;font-size:.82rem">';  h += '<strong>ΓÜá∩╕Å Important:</strong> It is better to complete membership selection, payment, and verification <em>before</em> the event day. ';  h += 'On the event day, people will need to provide this information at the door and it might take longer. ';  h += 'You can always come back and continue where you left off ΓÇö your progress is automatically saved.';  h += '</div>';  return h;}function statCard(icon, label, value, sub, color, pct) {  var h = '<div class="stat-card">';  h += '<div class="icon">' + icon + '</div>';  h += '<div class="value">' + value + '</div>';  h += '<div class="label">' + label + '</div>';  if (sub) h += '<div style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">' + sub + '</div>';  h += '<div class="bar" style="width:' + Math.min(100, pct || 0) + '%;background:' + (color || 'var(--accent)') + '"></div>';  h += '</div>';  return h;}function bindDashboardEvents() {}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// PIPELINE VIEW ΓÇö Full agent pipeline visualization// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderPipeline() {  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) { return r.rsvp === 'yes'; });  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒöä Agent Pipeline ΓÇö End-to-End Process</h2>';  // Pipeline flow diagram  h += '<div class="pipeline-flow" style="margin-bottom:24px">';  STATE.stages.forEach(function(stage, idx) {    var completed = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.stages[stage.id] && r.stages[stage.id].status === 'completed'; }).length;    var inProg = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.stages[stage.id] && r.stages[stage.id].status === 'in_progress'; }).length;    var pending = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.stages[stage.id] && r.stages[stage.id].status === 'pending'; }).length;    var cls = completed === yes.length ? 'completed' : (inProg > 0 || pending > 0) ? 'active' : '';    h += '<div class="pipeline-stage ' + cls + '">';    h += '<div class="stage-icon">' + stage.icon + '</div>';    h += '<div class="stage-name">' + esc(stage.name) + '</div>';    h += '<div style="font-size:.58rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(stage.agent) + '</div>';    h += '<div style="margin-top:6px">';    h += '<span class="tag completed" style="font-size:.58rem">' + completed + ' done</span> ';    if (inProg) h += '<span class="tag in_progress" style="font-size:.58rem">' + inProg + ' running</span> ';    if (pending) h += '<span class="tag pending" style="font-size:.58rem">' + pending + ' pending</span> ';    h += '</div></div>';    if (idx < STATE.stages.length - 1) h += '<div class="pipeline-arrow">ΓåÆ</div>';  });  h += '</div>';  // Per-member pipeline table  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>Member</th>';  STATE.stages.forEach(function(s) { h += '<th style="text-align:center">' + s.icon + ' ' + s.name.split(' ')[0] + '</th>'; });  h += '<th>Resume Point</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  yes.forEach(function(rec) {    h += '<tr>';    h += '<td><strong style="font-size:.82rem">' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong><br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.email) + '</span></td>';    STATE.stages.forEach(function(s) {      var st = rec.stages[s.id];      h += '<td style="text-align:center">' + stageStatusTag(st ? st.status : 'not_started') + '</td>';    });    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)">' + (rec.resumePoint ? esc(rec.resumePoint) : 'ΓÇö') + '</td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}function bindPipelineEvents() {}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// EMAIL READER AGENT VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderEmailAgent() {  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒôº Email Reader Agent</h2>';  h += '<div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px">';  h += '<h3 style="font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:8px">Agent Configuration</h3>';  h += '<div class="form-grid">';  h += '<div class="form-group"><label>Source</label><input value="Gmail API (banfjax@gmail.com)" readonly></div>';  h += '<div class="form-group"><label>Keywords</label><input value="bosonto utsob, boshonto, spring festival, utsob 2026" readonly></div>';  h += '<div class="form-group"><label>Status</label><span class="tag completed">Active ΓÇö Scanning</span></div>';  h += '<div class="form-group"><label>Last Scan</label><input value="' + new Date().toLocaleString() + '" readonly></div>';  h += '</div></div>';  h += '<h3 style="margin-bottom:12px">≡ƒô¿ Scanned Emails (' + STATE.pipeline.length + ')</h3>';  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>From</th><th>RSVP</th><th>Adults</th><th>Kids</th><th>Source</th><th>Status</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  STATE.pipeline.forEach(function(rec) {    h += '<tr>';    h += '<td><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong><br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.email) + '</span></td>';    h += '<td><span class="tag ' + rec.rsvp + '">' + rec.rsvp.toUpperCase() + '</span></td>';    h += '<td>' + rec.adults + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + rec.kids + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.stages.email_scan.detail || 'evite_api') + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + stageStatusTag(rec.stages.email_scan.status) + '</td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// EVENT ANALYZER AGENT VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderAnalyzerAgent() {  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) { return r.rsvp === 'yes'; });  var agg = STATE.aggregation;  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒôï Event Analyzer Agent</h2>';  h += '<div class="stat-grid">';  h += statCard('≡ƒæ¿ΓÇì≡ƒæ⌐ΓÇì≡ƒæºΓÇì≡ƒæª', 'Total Attendees', agg.totalAttendees, agg.totalAdults + ' adults + ' + agg.totalKids + ' kids', 'var(--accent)', 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒÑù', 'Veg', agg.vegCount, '', 'var(--success)', agg.vegCount / Math.max(agg.totalAttendees, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒìû', 'Non-Veg', agg.nonVegCount, '', 'var(--warn)', agg.nonVegCount / Math.max(agg.totalAttendees, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('Γ¥ô', 'Unknown Diet', agg.unknownDiet, 'Need to collect', 'var(--danger)', agg.unknownDiet / Math.max(agg.totalAttendees, 1) * 100);  h += '</div>';  h += '<h3 style="margin:20px 0 12px">≡ƒôè Analyzed Responses (Yes RSVPs)</h3>';  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>Member</th><th>Adults</th><th>Kids</th><th>Food</th><th>Household</th><th>Previous Membership</th><th>Status</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  yes.forEach(function(rec) {    h += '<tr>';    h += '<td><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong>';    if (rec.isECMember) h += ' <span class="tag ec">EC</span>';    h += '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.email) + '</span></td>';    h += '<td>' + rec.adults + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + rec.kids + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + esc(rec.dietary) + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + esc(rec.householdType) + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">' + (rec.previousCategories || []).join(', ') + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + stageStatusTag(rec.stages.evite_analysis.status) + '</td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// MEMBERSHIP AGENT VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderMembershipAgent() {  var filter = getSearchFilter();  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) {    return r.rsvp === 'yes' && matchesFilter(r, filter);  });  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒÄ» Membership Agent ΓÇö Selection & Recommendations</h2>';  // Summary  var done = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.selectedCategory; });  var pending = yes.filter(function(r) { return !r.selectedCategory; });  h += '<div class="stat-grid" style="margin-bottom:20px">';  h += statCard('Γ£à', 'Selected', done.length, '', 'var(--success)', done.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('ΓÅ│', 'Pending', pending.length, '', 'var(--warn)', pending.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒæÑ', 'Total Members', yes.length, '', 'var(--accent)', 100);  h += '</div>';  h += '<div style="margin-bottom:12px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);padding:10px;background:var(--card);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)">';  h += '≡ƒÆí <em>Bosonto Utsob is an inclusive event for Premium, Regular, and Cultural pass members. Click "Select Membership" to see recommended options for each member.</em>';  h += '</div>';  // Table  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>Member</th><th>RSVP Detail</th><th>Household</th><th>Previous Tiers</th><th>Recommended</th><th>Selected</th><th>Actions</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  yes.forEach(function(rec) {    var ma = rec.membershipAnalysis;    h += '<tr data-email="' + rec.email + '">';    h += '<td><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong>';    if (rec.isECMember) h += ' <span class="tag ec">EC</span>';    h += '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.email) + '</span></td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.78rem">' + rec.adults + 'A + ' + rec.kids + 'K</td>';    h += '<td>' + esc(ma ? ma.householdTier : rec.householdType) + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">' + (rec.previousCategories || []).join(', ') + '</td>';    h += '<td>';    if (ma && ma.recommended) {      h += '<span class="tag recommended">' + esc(ma.recommended.category.name) + '</span>';      h += '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">$' + ma.recommended.price + ' (' + ma.householdTier + ')</span>';      if (ma.upsellOpportunity) h += '<br><span style="font-size:.62rem;color:var(--warn)">Γ¼å∩╕Å Upsell: ' + esc(ma.upsellFrom) + ' ΓåÆ ' + esc(ma.upsellTo) + '</span>';    }    h += '</td>';    h += '<td>';    if (rec.selectedCategory) {      var selCat = getCategoryById(rec.selectedCategory);      h += '<span class="tag completed">' + (selCat ? esc(selCat.name) : esc(rec.selectedCategory)) + '</span>';      h += '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.selectedTier || '') + '</span>';    } else {      h += '<span class="tag pending">Not selected</span>';    }    h += '</td>';    h += '<td><button class="btn sm primary select-membership-btn" data-email="' + rec.email + '">' + (rec.selectedCategory ? 'Γ£Å∩╕Å Change' : '≡ƒÄ» Select') + '</button></td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}function bindMembershipEvents() {  document.querySelectorAll('.select-membership-btn').forEach(function(btn) {    btn.addEventListener('click', function() { openMembershipModal(btn.dataset.email); });  });}function openMembershipModal(email) {  var rec = findRecord(email);  if (!rec) return;  var ma = rec.membershipAnalysis;  if (!ma) { toast('No membership analysis available', 'error'); return; }  var body = '';  // Member info header  body += '<div style="background:var(--card);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:16px;border:1px solid var(--border)">';  body += '<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">';  body += '<div><strong style="font-size:.92rem">' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong>';  if (rec.isECMember) body += ' <span class="tag ec">EC</span>';  body += '<br><span style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.email) + '</span></div>';  body += '<div style="text-align:right;font-size:.78rem"><div>RSVP: ' + rec.adults + ' adults, ' + rec.kids + ' kids</div>';  body += '<div style="color:var(--muted)">Previous: ' + (rec.previousCategories || []).join(', ') + '</div>';  body += '<div style="color:var(--muted)">Member since: ' + esc(rec.memberSince || 'N/A') + '</div></div></div>';  // Reasoning  body += '<div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--accent2)">';  (ma.reasoning || []).forEach(function(r) { body += 'ΓÇó ' + esc(r) + '<br>'; });  body += '</div></div>';  // Household tier selector  body += '<div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom:16px"><label>Household Tier</label>';  body += '<select id="modalTierSelect">';  ['family','couple','individual','student'].forEach(function(t) {    body += '<option value="' + t + '"' + (t === ma.householdTier ? ' selected' : '') + '>' + t.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + t.slice(1) + '</option>';  });  body += '</select></div>';  // Recommended card  body += '<div id="membershipCards">';  body += buildMembershipCards(ma, ma.householdTier);  body += '</div>';  // Important note  body += '<div style="margin-top:16px;padding:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.08);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.2);border-radius:8px;font-size:.72rem">';  body += '≡ƒÆí You can come back and change your selection later. Your progress is automatically saved.';  body += '</div>';  var footer = '<button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close ΓÇö Continue Later</button>';  openModal('≡ƒÄ» Membership Selection ΓÇö ' + rec.displayName, body, footer);  // Tier change handler  document.getElementById('modalTierSelect').addEventListener('change', function() {    document.getElementById('membershipCards').innerHTML = buildMembershipCards(ma, this.value);    bindMembershipCardClicks(email);  });  bindMembershipCardClicks(email);}function buildMembershipCards(ma, tier) {  var h = '';  // Recommended  var rec = ma.recommended;  h += membershipCardHtml(rec.category, tier, true, rec.reason);  // Alternatives  ma.alternatives.forEach(function(alt) {    h += membershipCardHtml(alt.category, tier, false, alt.reason);  });  // Guest  h += membershipCardHtml(ma.guestOption.category, tier, false, ma.guestOption.reason);  return h;}function membershipCardHtml(cat, tier, isRecommended, reason) {  var price = cat.pricing[tier] || cat.pricing.individual || 0;  var h = '<div class="membership-card' + (isRecommended ? ' recommended-card' : '') + '" data-cat-id="' + cat.id + '">';  if (isRecommended) h += '<div class="card-badge" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8B0000,#C00020);color:#fff">Γ¡É RECOMMENDED</div>';  else if (cat.badge) h += '<div class="card-badge" style="background:var(--card);color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--border)">' + esc(cat.badge) + '</div>';  h += '<div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">' + cat.icon + '</span><span class="card-title">' + esc(cat.name) + '</span></div>';  if (cat.id === 'guest') {    h += '<div class="card-price" style="color:var(--muted)">Per Event</div>';  } else {    h += '<div class="card-price" style="color:' + cat.color + '">$' + price + '<span style="font-size:.5em;color:var(--muted)"> / ' + tier + '</span></div>';  }  h += '<div class="card-tagline">' + esc(cat.tagline) + '</div>';  if (reason) h += '<div style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:6px">≡ƒÆí ' + esc(reason) + '</div>';  if (cat.features && cat.features.length) {    h += '<ul class="card-features">';    cat.features.forEach(function(f) { h += '<li>' + esc(f) + '</li>'; });    h += '</ul>';  }  if (cat.highlight) h += '<div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:' + cat.color + '">' + cat.highlight + '</div>';  h += '<div style="margin-top:8px;text-align:center"><button class="btn primary sm select-this-btn" data-cat-id="' + cat.id + '">Select ' + esc(cat.name) + '</button></div>';  h += '</div>';  return h;}function bindMembershipCardClicks(email) {  document.querySelectorAll('.select-this-btn').forEach(function(btn) {    btn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {      e.stopPropagation();      var catId = btn.dataset.catId;      var tier = document.getElementById('modalTierSelect').value;      selectMembership(email, catId, tier);    });  });}function selectMembership(email, catId, tier) {  var rec = findRecord(email);  if (!rec) return;  var cat = getCategoryById(catId);  rec.selectedCategory = catId;  rec.selectedTier = tier;  rec.stages.membership_rec.status = 'completed';  rec.stages.membership_rec.detail = 'Selected: ' + (cat ? cat.name : catId) + ' (' + tier + ')';  rec.stages.membership_rec.timestamp = new Date().toISOString();  rec.stages.payment.status = 'pending';  rec.lastInteraction = new Date().toISOString();  rec.resumePoint = 'payment';  audit('Membership selected', rec.displayName + ' selected ' + (cat ? cat.name : catId) + ' (' + tier + ')', 'membership', email);  saveState();  closeModal();  toast(rec.displayName + ' ΓåÆ ' + (cat ? cat.name : catId) + ' (' + tier + ')', 'success');  // Auto-open payment modal  setTimeout(function() { openPaymentModal(email); }, 300);}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// PAYMENT AGENT VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderPaymentAgent() {  var filter = getSearchFilter();  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) {    return r.rsvp === 'yes' && r.selectedCategory && matchesFilter(r, filter);  });  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒÆ│ Payment Agent ΓÇö Collection & Tracking</h2>';  var paid = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.paymentStatus === 'paid'; });  var pending = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.paymentStatus !== 'paid'; });  h += '<div class="stat-grid">';  h += statCard('Γ£à', 'Paid', paid.length, '', 'var(--success)', paid.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('ΓÅ│', 'Pending', pending.length, '', 'var(--warn)', pending.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  var totalRevenue = paid.reduce(function(s, r) { var c = getCategoryById(r.selectedCategory); return s + (c ? (c.pricing[r.selectedTier] || 0) : 0); }, 0);  h += statCard('≡ƒÆ░', 'Revenue', '$' + totalRevenue, '', 'var(--teal)', 100);  h += '</div>';  if (yes.length === 0) {    h += '<div class="empty-state"><div class="icon">≡ƒÆ│</div><p>No members have selected membership yet. Go to Membership Agent first.</p></div>';    return h;  }  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>Member</th><th>Membership</th><th>Amount</th><th>Payment Method</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  yes.forEach(function(rec) {    var cat = getCategoryById(rec.selectedCategory);    var price = cat ? (cat.pricing[rec.selectedTier] || cat.pricing.individual || 0) : 0;    h += '<tr>';    h += '<td><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong><br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.email) + '</span></td>';    h += '<td>' + (cat ? esc(cat.name) : esc(rec.selectedCategory)) + '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.selectedTier || '') + '</span></td>';    h += '<td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--success)">$' + price + '</td>';    h += '<td>';    if (rec.selectedPaymentMethod) {      h += esc(rec.selectedPaymentMethod);      if (rec._paymentDate) h += '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">Due: ' + esc(rec._paymentDate) + '</span>';    } else {      h += '<span style="color:var(--muted)">Not selected</span>';    }    h += '</td>';    h += '<td>' + stageStatusTag(rec.paymentStatus === 'paid' ? 'completed' : rec.selectedPaymentMethod ? 'in_progress' : 'pending') + '</td>';    h += '<td><button class="btn sm primary payment-modal-btn" data-email="' + rec.email + '">' + (rec.paymentStatus === 'paid' ? 'Γ£à Done' : '≡ƒÆ│ Pay') + '</button></td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}function bindPaymentEvents() {  document.querySelectorAll('.payment-modal-btn').forEach(function(btn) {    btn.addEventListener('click', function() { openPaymentModal(btn.dataset.email); });  });}function openPaymentModal(email) {  var rec = findRecord(email);  if (!rec || !rec.selectedCategory) { toast('Select membership first', 'error'); return; }  var cat = getCategoryById(rec.selectedCategory);  var price = cat ? (cat.pricing[rec.selectedTier] || cat.pricing.individual || 0) : 0;  var body = '';  body += '<div style="background:var(--card);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:16px;border:1px solid var(--border)">';  body += '<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">';  body += '<div><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong><br><span style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)">' + (cat ? esc(cat.name) : '') + ' (' + esc(rec.selectedTier || '') + ')</span></div>';  body += '<div style="text-align:right;font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--success)">$' + price + '</div>';  body += '</div></div>';  // Payment options  body += '<h4 style="font-size:.82rem;margin-bottom:12px">Select Payment Method</h4>';  // Option 1: Pay Now via Zelle  body += '<div class="payment-option' + (rec.selectedPaymentMethod === 'zelle_now' ? ' selected' : '') + '" data-method="zelle_now">';  body += '<div class="po-icon">ΓÜí</div><div>';  body += '<div class="po-title">Pay Now via Zelle</div>';  body += '<div class="po-desc">Immediate payment. Send $' + price + ' to ' + esc(STATE.event.zelleEmail) + '</div>';  body += '</div></div>';  // Zelle details (shown when selected)  body += '<div id="zelleDetails" style="display:none;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:0 0 12px 0">';  body += '<div style="display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">';  body += '<div class="qr-box">≡ƒô▒ QR Code<br><span style="font-size:.58rem">Zelle to ' + esc(STATE.event.zelleEmail) + '</span></div>';  body += '<div><strong>Zelle Payment Instructions:</strong>';  body += '<ol style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);padding-left:20px;margin-top:8px">';  body += '<li>Open your Zelle app or bank\'s Zelle feature</li>';  body += '<li>Send <strong style="color:var(--success)">$' + price + '</strong> to: <strong>' + esc(STATE.event.zelleEmail) + '</strong></li>';  body += '<li>Name: <strong>' + esc(STATE.event.zelleName) + '</strong></li>';  body += '<li>Memo: <strong>BANF Membership ' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong></li>';  body += '<li>Send screenshot to banfjax@gmail.com</li>';  body += '</ol></div></div>';  body += '<div style="margin-top:12px"><button class="btn success" id="confirmZelleNow">Γ£à I\'ve Sent the Zelle Payment</button></div>';  body += '</div>';  // Option 2: Pay on event day  body += '<div class="payment-option' + (rec.selectedPaymentMethod === 'event_day' ? ' selected' : '') + '" data-method="event_day">';  body += '<div class="po-icon">≡ƒôà</div><div>';  body += '<div class="po-title">Pay on Bosonto Utsob Day (' + STATE.event.date + ')</div>';  body += '<div class="po-desc">Choose: Cash, Cheque, or Zelle at the event</div>';  body += '</div></div>';  // Event day sub-options  body += '<div id="eventDayDetails" style="display:none;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:0 0 12px 0">';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Payment Mode on Event Day</label>';  body += '<select id="eventDayMode">';  body += '<option value="cash">≡ƒÆ╡ Cash</option>';  body += '<option value="cheque">≡ƒÅª Cheque (payable to BANF)</option>';  body += '<option value="zelle_event">≡ƒô▒ Zelle at event</option>';  body += '</select></div>';  body += '<button class="btn success" id="confirmEventDay">Γ£à Confirm ΓÇö Will Pay on Event Day</button>';  body += '</div>';  // Option 3: Future date payment  body += '<div class="payment-option' + (rec.selectedPaymentMethod === 'future_date' ? ' selected' : '') + '" data-method="future_date">';  body += '<div class="po-icon">≡ƒôå</div><div>';  body += '<div class="po-title">Schedule Future Payment</div>';  body += '<div class="po-desc">Set a date before ' + STATE.event.paymentDeadline + ' to make payment</div>';  body += '</div></div>';  // Future date details  body += '<div id="futureDateDetails" style="display:none;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:0 0 12px 0">';  body += '<div class="form-grid">';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Payment Date (on or before ' + STATE.event.paymentDeadline + ')</label>';  body += '<input type="date" id="futurePayDate" max="2026-04-30" min="' + new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10) + '"></div>';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Payment Mode</label>';  body += '<select id="futurePayMode">';  body += '<option value="zelle">≡ƒô▒ Zelle</option>';  body += '<option value="cash">≡ƒÆ╡ Cash</option>';  body += '<option value="cheque">≡ƒÅª Cheque</option>';  body += '</select></div>';  body += '</div>';  body += '<button class="btn success" id="confirmFutureDate">Γ£à Confirm Future Payment</button>';  body += '</div>';  body += '<div style="margin-top:12px;padding:10px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.08);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.2);border-radius:8px;font-size:.72rem">';  body += 'ΓÜá∩╕Å It\'s best to complete payment before the event to avoid delays at the door. You can come back and update your payment method at any time.';  body += '</div>';  var footer = '<button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Come Back Later</button>';  openModal('≡ƒÆ│ Payment ΓÇö ' + rec.displayName + ' ($' + price + ')', body, footer);  // Bind payment option clicks  document.querySelectorAll('.payment-option').forEach(function(opt) {    opt.addEventListener('click', function() {      document.querySelectorAll('.payment-option').forEach(function(o) { o.classList.remove('selected'); });      opt.classList.add('selected');      document.getElementById('zelleDetails').style.display = opt.dataset.method === 'zelle_now' ? 'block' : 'none';      document.getElementById('eventDayDetails').style.display = opt.dataset.method === 'event_day' ? 'block' : 'none';      document.getElementById('futureDateDetails').style.display = opt.dataset.method === 'future_date' ? 'block' : 'none';    });  });  // Confirm Zelle Now  var zelleBtn = document.getElementById('confirmZelleNow');  if (zelleBtn) zelleBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {    completePayment(email, 'zelle_now', 'Zelle ΓÇö Paid Now', null);  });  // Confirm Event Day  var edBtn = document.getElementById('confirmEventDay');  if (edBtn) edBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {    var mode = document.getElementById('eventDayMode').value;    var label = mode === 'cash' ? 'Cash at event' : mode === 'cheque' ? 'Cheque at event' : 'Zelle at event';    completePayment(email, 'event_day', label, STATE.event.date);  });  // Confirm Future Date  var fdBtn = document.getElementById('confirmFutureDate');  if (fdBtn) fdBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {    var dt = document.getElementById('futurePayDate').value;    var mode = document.getElementById('futurePayMode').value;    if (!dt) { toast('Please select a date', 'error'); return; }    if (dt > '2026-04-30') { toast('Date must be on or before April 30, 2026', 'error'); return; }    var label = mode.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + mode.slice(1) + ' on ' + dt;    completePayment(email, 'future_date', label, dt);  });}function completePayment(email, method, label, date) {  var rec = findRecord(email);  if (!rec) return;  rec.selectedPaymentMethod = method;  rec._paymentMethodLabel = label;  rec._paymentDate = date;  if (method === 'zelle_now') {    rec.paymentStatus = 'paid';    rec.stages.payment.status = 'completed';  } else {    rec.paymentStatus = 'pending';    rec.stages.payment.status = 'in_progress';  }  rec.stages.payment.detail = label;  rec.stages.payment.timestamp = new Date().toISOString();  rec.lastInteraction = new Date().toISOString();  rec.resumePoint = 'comm_verify';  // Also mark comm_verify as pending if not done  if (!rec.commVerified) {    rec.stages.comm_verify.status = 'pending';  }  audit('Payment method set', rec.displayName + ': ' + label, 'payment', email);  saveState();  closeModal();  toast('Payment: ' + label, 'success');  // Auto-open comm verification if not done  if (!rec.commVerified) {    setTimeout(function() { openCommVerifyModal(email); }, 300);  } else {    render(currentView);  }}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// COMMUNICATION VERIFICATION AGENT VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderCommAgent() {  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) { return r.rsvp === 'yes'; });  var verified = yes.filter(function(r) { return r.commVerified; });  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">Γ£à Communication Verification Agent</h2>';  h += '<div class="stat-grid">';  h += statCard('Γ£à', 'Verified', verified.length, '', 'var(--success)', verified.length / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('ΓÅ│', 'Pending', (yes.length - verified.length), '', 'var(--warn)', (yes.length - verified.length) / Math.max(yes.length, 1) * 100);  h += '</div>';  h += '<div style="margin-bottom:12px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);padding:10px;background:var(--card);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)">';  h += '≡ƒôï Verify that each member\'s name, phone, address, and family members are correct. This data feeds into the CRM database.';  h += '</div>';  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>Member</th><th>Phone</th><th>Address</th><th>Family Members</th><th>Verified</th><th>Actions</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  yes.forEach(function(rec) {    h += '<tr>';    h += '<td><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong><br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.email) + '</span></td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.78rem">' + (rec.phone ? esc(rec.phone) : '<span style="color:var(--danger)">Missing!</span>') + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">';    if (rec.address || rec.city) {      h += esc((rec.address ? rec.address + ', ' : '') + (rec.city || '') + (rec.state ? ', ' + rec.state : '') + (rec.zip ? ' ' + rec.zip : ''));    } else {      h += '<span style="color:var(--danger)">Missing!</span>';    }    h += '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">';    if (rec.householdMembers && rec.householdMembers.length > 0) {      rec.householdMembers.forEach(function(hm) { h += esc(hm.name) + '<br>'; });    } else {      h += '<span style="color:var(--muted)">No family members</span>';    }    h += '</td>';    h += '<td>' + (rec.commVerified ? '<span class="tag completed">Γ£à Verified</span>' : '<span class="tag pending">Pending</span>') + '</td>';    h += '<td><button class="btn sm comm-verify-btn" data-email="' + rec.email + '">' + (rec.commVerified ? 'Γ£Å∩╕Å Edit' : 'Γ£à Verify') + '</button></td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}function bindCommEvents() {  document.querySelectorAll('.comm-verify-btn').forEach(function(btn) {    btn.addEventListener('click', function() { openCommVerifyModal(btn.dataset.email); });  });}function openCommVerifyModal(email) {  var rec = findRecord(email);  if (!rec) return;  var body = '';  body += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:12px">Please verify and update your details. This ensures our CRM has your correct information.</div>';  body += '<div class="form-grid">';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Full Name</label><input id="cv_name" value="' + esc(rec.displayName) + '"></div>';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Email (read-only)</label><input value="' + esc(rec.email) + '" readonly></div>';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Phone</label><input id="cv_phone" value="' + esc(rec.phone || '') + '" placeholder="Phone number"></div>';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Phone 2</label><input id="cv_phone2" value="" placeholder="Alt phone (optional)"></div>';  body += '<div class="form-group" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label>Address</label><input id="cv_address" value="' + esc(rec.address || '') + '" placeholder="Street address"></div>';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>City</label><input id="cv_city" value="' + esc(rec.city || '') + '"></div>';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>State</label><input id="cv_state" value="' + esc(rec.state || 'FL') + '"></div>';  body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Zip</label><input id="cv_zip" value="' + esc(rec.zip || '') + '"></div>';  body += '</div>';  // Family members  body += '<h4 style="font-size:.82rem;margin:16px 0 8px">≡ƒæ¿ΓÇì≡ƒæ⌐ΓÇì≡ƒæºΓÇì≡ƒæª Family Members</h4>';  body += '<div id="cv_family_list">';  if (rec.householdMembers && rec.householdMembers.length > 0) {    rec.householdMembers.forEach(function(hm, idx) {      body += '<div class="form-grid" style="margin-bottom:8px;padding:8px;background:var(--card);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)">';      body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Name</label><input class="cv_fm_name" value="' + esc(hm.name || '') + '" data-idx="' + idx + '"></div>';      body += '<div class="form-group"><label>Email</label><input class="cv_fm_email" value="' + esc(hm.email || '') + '" data-idx="' + idx + '"></div>';      body += '</div>';    });  } else {    body += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px">No family members on file. Add below if applicable.</div>';  }  body += '</div>';  body += '<button class="btn sm" id="cv_add_family">∩╝ï Add Family Member</button>';  body += '<div style="margin-top:16px;padding:10px;background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.2);border-radius:8px;font-size:.72rem">';  body += 'Γ£à Confirming this will update the CRM with your verified information.';  body += '</div>';  var footer = '<button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Skip ΓÇö Come Back Later</button>';  footer += '<button class="btn success" id="cv_confirm">Γ£à Confirm & Verify</button>';  openModal('Γ£à Verify Your Details ΓÇö ' + rec.displayName, body, footer);  // Add family member  document.getElementById('cv_add_family').addEventListener('click', function() {    var list = document.getElementById('cv_family_list');    var idx = list.querySelectorAll('.cv_fm_name').length;    var newRow = document.createElement('div');    newRow.className = 'form-grid';    newRow.style.cssText = 'margin-bottom:8px;padding:8px;background:var(--card);border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)';    newRow.innerHTML = '<div class="form-group"><label>Name</label><input class="cv_fm_name" value="" data-idx="' + idx + '" placeholder="Family member name"></div>' +      '<div class="form-group"><label>Email</label><input class="cv_fm_email" value="" data-idx="' + idx + '" placeholder="Email (optional)"></div>';    list.appendChild(newRow);  });  // Confirm  document.getElementById('cv_confirm').addEventListener('click', function() {    rec._editedName = document.getElementById('cv_name').value;    rec._editedPhone = document.getElementById('cv_phone').value;    rec._editedAddress = document.getElementById('cv_address').value;    rec._editedCity = document.getElementById('cv_city').value;    rec.displayName = rec._editedName || rec.displayName;    rec.phone = rec._editedPhone || rec.phone;    rec.address = rec._editedAddress || rec.address;    rec.city = rec._editedCity || rec.city;    rec.state = document.getElementById('cv_state').value || rec.state;    rec.zip = document.getElementById('cv_zip').value || rec.zip;    // Collect family members    var fmNames = document.querySelectorAll('.cv_fm_name');    var fmEmails = document.querySelectorAll('.cv_fm_email');    var newFM = [];    fmNames.forEach(function(el, i) {      var name = el.value.trim();      var em = fmEmails[i] ? fmEmails[i].value.trim() : '';      if (name) newFM.push({ name: name, email: em, firstName: name.split(' ')[0], lastName: name.split(' ').slice(1).join(' ') });    });    rec.householdMembers = newFM;    rec._editedFamilyMembers = newFM;    rec.commVerified = true;    rec.stages.comm_verify.status = 'completed';    rec.stages.comm_verify.detail = 'Verified at ' + new Date().toLocaleString();    rec.stages.comm_verify.timestamp = new Date().toISOString();    rec.lastInteraction = new Date().toISOString();    // Mark event mgmt as completed if all prior stages done    if (rec.selectedCategory && (rec.paymentStatus === 'paid' || rec.selectedPaymentMethod)) {      rec.stages.event_mgmt.status = 'completed';      rec.stages.event_mgmt.detail = 'Fully processed: ' + rec.adults + 'A + ' + rec.kids + 'K';      rec.stages.event_mgmt.timestamp = new Date().toISOString();      rec.resumePoint = null; // All done!    } else {      rec.resumePoint = 'payment';    }    audit('Communication verified', rec.displayName + ' details verified', 'comm_verify', email);    saveState();    closeModal();    toast(rec.displayName + ' verified Γ£à', 'success');    render(currentView);  });}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// EVENT MANAGEMENT AGENT VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderEventAgent() {  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) { return r.rsvp === 'yes'; });  var agg = STATE.aggregation;  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒÄ¬ Event Management Agent ΓÇö Bosonto Utsob 2026</h2>';  h += '<div class="stat-grid">';  h += statCard('≡ƒæ¿ΓÇì≡ƒæ⌐ΓÇì≡ƒæºΓÇì≡ƒæª', 'Total Attendees', agg.totalAttendees, agg.totalAdults + ' adults + ' + agg.totalKids + ' kids', 'var(--accent)', agg.totalAttendees / STATE.event.capacity * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒôè', 'Capacity Used', Math.round(agg.totalAttendees / STATE.event.capacity * 100) + '%', agg.totalAttendees + '/' + STATE.event.capacity, 'var(--info)', agg.totalAttendees / STATE.event.capacity * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒæ¿', 'Adults', agg.totalAdults, '', 'var(--accent2)', agg.totalAdults / Math.max(agg.totalAttendees, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒæº', 'Kids', agg.totalKids, '', 'var(--pink)', agg.totalKids / Math.max(agg.totalAttendees, 1) * 100);  h += statCard('≡ƒì╜∩╕Å', 'Veg', agg.vegCount, '', 'var(--success)', 50);  h += statCard('≡ƒìû', 'Non-Veg', agg.nonVegCount, '', 'var(--warn)', 50);  h += '</div>';  // Detailed breakdown  h += '<h3 style="margin:20px 0 12px">≡ƒôï Attendance Details</h3>';  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>Member</th><th>Adults</th><th>Kids</th><th>Total</th><th>Dietary</th><th>Membership</th><th>Payment</th><th>Verified</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  yes.forEach(function(rec) {    var cat = getCategoryById(rec.selectedCategory);    h += '<tr>';    h += '<td><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong>';    if (rec.householdMembers && rec.householdMembers.length) h += '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + rec.householdMembers.map(function(hm) { return esc(hm.name); }).join(', ') + '</span>';    h += '</td>';    h += '<td>' + rec.adults + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + rec.kids + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-weight:700">' + (rec.adults + rec.kids) + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + esc(rec.dietary) + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">' + (cat ? esc(cat.name) : '<span class="tag pending">Pending</span>') + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + stageStatusTag(rec.paymentStatus === 'paid' ? 'completed' : rec.selectedPaymentMethod ? 'in_progress' : 'not_started') + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + (rec.commVerified ? 'Γ£à' : 'Γ¥î') + '</td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// MEMBER PROCESS VIEW ΓÇö Full workflow per member// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderMemberProcess() {  var filter = getSearchFilter();  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) {    return r.rsvp === 'yes' && matchesFilter(r, filter);  });  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒæñ Member Workflows ΓÇö Individual Process Tracking</h2>';  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>Member</th><th>Progress</th><th>Membership</th><th>Payment</th><th>Verified</th><th>Resume Point</th><th>Actions</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  yes.forEach(function(rec) {    var totalStages = 6;    var completedStages = 0;    Object.keys(rec.stages).forEach(function(k) {      if (rec.stages[k].status === 'completed' || rec.stages[k].status === 'skipped') completedStages++;    });    var pct = Math.round(completedStages / totalStages * 100);    h += '<tr>';    h += '<td><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong>';    if (rec.isECMember) h += ' <span class="tag ec">EC</span>';    h += '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(rec.email) + '</span></td>';    // Progress bar    h += '<td style="min-width:140px">';    h += '<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px">';    h += '<div style="flex:1;height:6px;background:var(--border);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden"><div style="height:100%;width:' + pct + '%;background:var(--success);border-radius:3px"></div></div>';    h += '<span style="font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;color:' + (pct === 100 ? 'var(--success)' : 'var(--muted)') + '">' + pct + '%</span>';    h += '</div>';    h += '<div class="progress-steps" style="margin:4px 0 0">';    STATE.stages.forEach(function(s) {      var st = rec.stages[s.id];      var cls = st && st.status === 'completed' ? 'done' : (st && (st.status === 'pending' || st.status === 'in_progress') ? 'current' : '');      h += '<div class="progress-step ' + cls + '" title="' + esc(s.name) + ': ' + (st ? st.status : 'not_started') + '"></div>';    });    h += '</div></td>';    // Membership    var cat = getCategoryById(rec.selectedCategory);    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">' + (cat ? esc(cat.name) + '<br>' + esc(rec.selectedTier || '') : '<span class="tag pending">Pending</span>') + '</td>';    // Payment    h += '<td>' + stageStatusTag(rec.paymentStatus === 'paid' ? 'completed' : rec.selectedPaymentMethod ? 'in_progress' : 'not_started') + '</td>';    // Verified    h += '<td>' + (rec.commVerified ? 'Γ£à' : 'Γ¥î') + '</td>';    // Resume point    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--accent2)">' + (rec.resumePoint ? esc(rec.resumePoint) : (pct === 100 ? '≡ƒÄë Complete!' : 'ΓÇö')) + '</td>';    // Actions    h += '<td>';    if (!rec.selectedCategory) {      h += '<button class="btn sm primary mp-action" data-email="' + rec.email + '" data-action="membership">≡ƒÄ» Start</button>';    } else if (rec.paymentStatus !== 'paid' && !rec.selectedPaymentMethod) {      h += '<button class="btn sm primary mp-action" data-email="' + rec.email + '" data-action="payment">≡ƒÆ│ Pay</button>';    } else if (!rec.commVerified) {      h += '<button class="btn sm primary mp-action" data-email="' + rec.email + '" data-action="verify">Γ£à Verify</button>';    } else {      h += '<span style="color:var(--success);font-weight:700">Γ£à Done</span>';    }    h += '</td></tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}function bindMemberProcessEvents() {  document.querySelectorAll('.mp-action').forEach(function(btn) {    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {      var email = btn.dataset.email;      var action = btn.dataset.action;      if (action === 'membership') openMembershipModal(email);      else if (action === 'payment') openPaymentModal(email);      else if (action === 'verify') openCommVerifyModal(email);    });  });}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// TEST MEMBER VIEW ΓÇö ranadhir.ghosh@gmail.com walkthrough// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderTestMember() {  var rec = findRecord('ranadhir.ghosh@gmail.com');  if (!rec) {    return '<div class="empty-state"><div class="icon">≡ƒº¬</div><p>Test member ranadhir.ghosh@gmail.com not found in pipeline</p></div>';  }  var ma = rec.membershipAnalysis;  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒº¬ Test Walkthrough ΓÇö ' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</h2>';  // Member profile card  h += '<div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(99,102,241,.08),rgba(167,139,250,.08));border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,.2);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px">';  h += '<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px">';  h += '<div>';  h += '<h3 style="font-size:1.1rem">' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</h3>';  if (rec.isECMember) h += '<span class="tag ec" style="margin-left:0">EC Member</span> ';  h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px">' + esc(rec.email) + '</div>';  h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)">≡ƒô₧ ' + esc(rec.phone || 'N/A') + ' ┬╖ ≡ƒôì ' + esc(rec.city || 'N/A') + ', ' + esc(rec.state || '') + '</div>';  h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)">Member since: ' + esc(rec.memberSince || 'N/A') + ' ┬╖ Total paid: $' + (rec.totalPaid || 0) + '</div>';  h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)">Previous: ' + (rec.previousCategories || []).join(', ') + '</div>';  h += '</div>';  h += '<div style="text-align:right">';  h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)">RSVP Detail</div>';  h += '<div style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700">' + rec.adults + ' Adults + ' + rec.kids + ' Kids</div>';  h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)">Household: ' + esc(rec.householdType) + '</div>';  if (rec.householdMembers && rec.householdMembers.length) {    h += '<div style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--accent2)">Family: ' + rec.householdMembers.map(function(hm) { return esc(hm.name); }).join(', ') + '</div>';  }  h += '</div></div></div>';  // Process Timeline  h += '<h3 style="margin-bottom:12px">≡ƒôê Process Pipeline</h3>';  h += '<div class="timeline" style="margin-bottom:20px">';  STATE.stages.forEach(function(stage) {    var st = rec.stages[stage.id];    var cls = st.status === 'completed' ? 'done' : (st.status === 'pending' || st.status === 'in_progress') ? 'active' : 'pending';    h += '<div class="timeline-item ' + cls + '">';    h += '<div style="font-weight:600;font-size:.82rem">' + stage.icon + ' ' + esc(stage.name) + ' <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem">(' + esc(stage.agent) + ')</span></div>';    h += '<div style="font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)">' + stageStatusTag(st.status) + ' ' + esc(st.detail || '') + '</div>';    if (st.timestamp) h += '<div style="font-size:.62rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">' + new Date(st.timestamp).toLocaleString() + '</div>';    h += '</div>';  });  h += '</div>';  // Membership Analysis  if (ma) {    h += '<h3 style="margin-bottom:12px">≡ƒÄ» Membership Agent Analysis</h3>';    h += '<div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:20px">';    h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:8px">';    (ma.reasoning || []).forEach(function(r) { h += 'ΓÇó ' + esc(r) + '<br>'; });    h += '</div>';    h += '<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:12px">Recommended: <span style="color:' + ma.recommended.category.color + '">' + esc(ma.recommended.category.name) + ' (' + ma.householdTier + ') ΓÇö $' + ma.recommended.price + '</span></div>';    h += '<div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)">Alternatives:</div><ul style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);padding-left:20px">';    (ma.alternatives || []).forEach(function(alt) {      h += '<li>' + esc(alt.category.name) + ' ΓÇö $' + alt.price + ' (' + esc(alt.reason) + ')</li>';    });    h += '<li>Guest ΓÇö Per event (no membership)</li>';    h += '</ul></div>';  }  // Current selections  h += '<h3 style="margin-bottom:12px">≡ƒô¥ Current Selections</h3>';  h += '<div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:20px">';  var cat = getCategoryById(rec.selectedCategory);  h += '<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px">';  h += '<div><div style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">MEMBERSHIP</div><div style="font-weight:600">' + (cat ? esc(cat.name) + ' (' + esc(rec.selectedTier || '') + ')' : '<span style="color:var(--warn)">Not selected</span>') + '</div></div>';  h += '<div><div style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">PAYMENT</div><div style="font-weight:600">' + (rec.selectedPaymentMethod ? esc(rec._paymentMethodLabel || rec.selectedPaymentMethod) : '<span style="color:var(--warn)">Not selected</span>') + '</div></div>';  h += '<div><div style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">VERIFIED</div><div style="font-weight:600">' + (rec.commVerified ? '<span style="color:var(--success)">Γ£à Yes</span>' : '<span style="color:var(--warn)">No</span>') + '</div></div>';  h += '<div><div style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">RESUME POINT</div><div style="font-weight:600">' + (rec.resumePoint || 'ΓÇö') + '</div></div>';  h += '</div></div>';  // Action buttons  h += '<div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">';  if (!rec.selectedCategory) {    h += '<button class="btn primary lg test-action" data-action="membership" data-email="' + rec.email + '">≡ƒÄ» Step 1: Select Membership</button>';  } else if (!rec.selectedPaymentMethod) {    h += '<button class="btn primary lg test-action" data-action="payment" data-email="' + rec.email + '">≡ƒÆ│ Step 2: Choose Payment</button>';  } else if (!rec.commVerified) {    h += '<button class="btn primary lg test-action" data-action="verify" data-email="' + rec.email + '">Γ£à Step 3: Verify Details</button>';  } else {    h += '<button class="btn success lg" disabled>≡ƒÄë All Steps Complete!</button>';  }  h += '<button class="btn test-action" data-action="membership" data-email="' + rec.email + '">≡ƒÄ» Membership</button>';  h += '<button class="btn test-action" data-action="payment" data-email="' + rec.email + '">≡ƒÆ│ Payment</button>';  h += '<button class="btn test-action" data-action="verify" data-email="' + rec.email + '">Γ£à Verify</button>';  h += '<button class="btn danger" id="resetTestBtn">≡ƒöä Reset Test State</button>';  h += '</div>';  return h;}function bindTestMemberEvents() {  document.querySelectorAll('.test-action').forEach(function(btn) {    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {      var email = btn.dataset.email;      var action = btn.dataset.action;      if (action === 'membership') openMembershipModal(email);      else if (action === 'payment') openPaymentModal(email);      else if (action === 'verify') openCommVerifyModal(email);    });  });  var resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetTestBtn');  if (resetBtn) resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {    var rec = findRecord('ranadhir.ghosh@gmail.com');    if (!rec) return;    rec.selectedCategory = null;    rec.selectedTier = null;    rec.selectedPaymentMethod = null;    rec._paymentMethodLabel = null;    rec._paymentDate = null;    rec.paymentStatus = 'not_started';    rec.commVerified = false;    rec.resumePoint = 'membership';    rec.stages.membership_rec.status = 'pending';    rec.stages.membership_rec.detail = '';    rec.stages.membership_rec.timestamp = null;    rec.stages.payment.status = 'not_started';    rec.stages.payment.detail = '';    rec.stages.payment.timestamp = null;    rec.stages.comm_verify.status = 'not_started';    rec.stages.comm_verify.detail = '';    rec.stages.comm_verify.timestamp = null;    rec.stages.event_mgmt.status = 'pending';    rec.stages.event_mgmt.detail = '';    rec.stages.event_mgmt.timestamp = null;    audit('Test reset', 'Reset all selections for ' + rec.displayName, 'test', rec.email);    saveState();    toast('Test state reset', 'success');    render('test_member');  });}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// ATTENDANCE REPORT VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderAttendance() {  var yes = STATE.pipeline.filter(function(r) { return r.rsvp === 'yes'; });  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒô¥ Attendance Report ΓÇö Bosonto Utsob 2026</h2>';  // Summary box  var totalA = 0, totalK = 0;  yes.forEach(function(r) { totalA += r.adults; totalK += r.kids; });  h += '<div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:20px">';  h += '<div style="display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.88rem">';  h += '<div><strong>Total Attendees:</strong> ' + (totalA + totalK) + '</div>';  h += '<div><strong>Adults:</strong> ' + totalA + '</div>';  h += '<div><strong>Kids:</strong> ' + totalK + '</div>';  h += '<div><strong>Families/Individuals:</strong> ' + yes.length + '</div>';  h += '</div></div>';  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>#</th><th>Name</th><th>Email</th><th>Phone</th><th>Adults</th><th>Kids</th><th>Total</th><th>Dietary</th><th>Membership</th><th>Paid</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  yes.forEach(function(rec, idx) {    var cat = getCategoryById(rec.selectedCategory);    h += '<tr>';    h += '<td>' + (idx + 1) + '</td>';    h += '<td><strong>' + esc(rec.displayName) + '</strong>';    if (rec.householdMembers && rec.householdMembers.length) h += '<br><span style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)">' + rec.householdMembers.map(function(hm) { return esc(hm.name); }).join(', ') + '</span>';    h += '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">' + esc(rec.email) + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">' + esc(rec.phone || 'ΓÇö') + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + rec.adults + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + rec.kids + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-weight:700">' + (rec.adults + rec.kids) + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + esc(rec.dietary) + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">' + (cat ? esc(cat.name) : 'ΓÇö') + '</td>';    h += '<td>' + (rec.paymentStatus === 'paid' ? 'Γ£à' : 'Γ¥î') + '</td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  return h;}// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉ// AUDIT TRAIL VIEW// ΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉΓòÉfunction renderAudit() {  var h = '<h2 style="margin-bottom:16px">≡ƒô£ Audit Trail</h2>';  var audits = STATE.audit || [];  if (audits.length === 0) {    h += '<div class="empty-state"><div class="icon">≡ƒô£</div><p>No audit entries yet. Actions will be logged here.</p></div>';    return h;  }  h += '<div style="margin-bottom:12px"><input class="search-input" id="auditFilter" placeholder="≡ƒöì Filter audit entries..."></div>';  h += '<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>';  h += '<th>Time</th><th>Action</th><th>Detail</th><th>Category</th><th>Member</th>';  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';  audits.forEach(function(a) {    h += '<tr class="audit-entry">';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap">' + new Date(a.timestamp).toLocaleString() + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-weight:600;font-size:.82rem">' + esc(a.action) + '</td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)">' + esc(a.detail) + '</td>';    h += '<td><span class="tag">' + esc(a.category) + '</span></td>';    h += '<td style="font-size:.72rem">' + esc(a.email) + '</td>';    h += '</tr>';  });  h += '</tbody></table></div>';  // Bind filter  setTimeout(function() {    var filterEl = document.getElementById('auditFilter');    if (filterEl) filterEl.addEventListener('input', function(e) {      var q = e.target.value.toLowerCase();      document.querySelectorAll('.audit-entry').forEach(function(row) {        row.style.display = row.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(q) ? '' : 'none';      });    });  }, 100);  return h;}